1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,138
DNA is a polymer of nucleotides.

2
00:00:03,138 --> 00:00:05,794
Each nucleotide has three parts.

3
00:00:05,794 --> 00:00:07,213
A phosphate group.

4
00:00:07,213 --> 00:00:10,169
A five carbon sugar, deoxyribose.

5
00:00:10,169 --> 00:00:12,161
And a nitrogenous base.

6
00:00:12,161 --> 00:00:18,059
Base plus sugar alone is a nucleoside; add the phosphate and it becomes a nucleotide.

